{"key":"variable-window-a56fc3e233a36249","sourceHash":"a56fc3e233a362492861362baf618ea01fd41f9ec43c1c75f8ea0f2b47572133","pattern":"variable-window","category":"sliding-window","title":"Variable-Size Window: Mental Model","idea":"Expand until a constraint fails, then shrink until it is valid again.","complexity":"O(n) time · O(1) or state space","source":"fn shortest_sum(values: &[i32], target: i32) -> usize {\n    assert!(values.iter().all(|&x| x > 0));\n    let (mut left, mut sum, mut best) = (0, 0, usize::MAX);\n    for (right, &x) in values.iter().enumerate() {\n        sum += x;\n        while sum >= target {\n            best = best.min(right - left + 1);\n            sum -= values[left];\n            left += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    if best == usize::MAX { 0 } else { best }\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = shortest_sum(&[2, 3, 1, 2, 4, 3], 7).to_string();\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":2,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"assert!(values.iter().all(|&x| x > 0));"},{"line":3,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"let (mut left, mut sum, mut best) = (0, 0, usize::MAX);"},{"line":4,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"for (right, &x) in values.iter().enumerate() {"},{"line":5,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"sum += x;"},{"line":6,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"while sum >= target {"},{"line":7,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"best = best.min(right - left + 1);"},{"line":8,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"sum -= values[left];"},{"line":9,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"left += 1;"},{"line":10,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"}"},{"line":12,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"if best == usize::MAX { 0 } else { best }"},{"line":12,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"0"},{"line":12,"function":"shortest_sum","statement":"best"},{"line":16,"function":"main","statement":"let result = shortest_sum(&[2, 3, 1, 2, 4, 3], 7).to_string();"},{"line":17,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":18,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"[2,3,1,2,4,3]","stdout":"2\n","values":[{"type":"&[i32]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"7"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"18446744073709551615"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"6"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"8"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"4"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"10"}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"5"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"9"}},{"type":"alloc::string::String","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"\"2\""}}],"frames":[{"site":12,"stack":[["main",1]],"locals":[]},{"site":0,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1]]},{"site":1,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1]]},{"site":2,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",3],["best",4]]},{"site":3,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",3],["best",4],["right",2],["x",5]]},{"site":4,"stack":[["main",1],["shortest_sum",2]],"locals":[["values",0],["target",1],["left",2],["sum",5],["best",4],["right",2